---

import Layout from '../layouts/main-layout.astro';
import HeroHeaderComponent from '../components/react/hero/hero-header-v2.jsx';
import styles from './terms-and-conditions.module.scss';

---


<Layout>


    {
        /*
            page specific meta tags
        */
    }
    <meta slot="head" name="keywords" content='SEO, search engine optimization, local SEO, AI agent development, AI automation, web development, website design, Lehi Utah, Utah County, Salt Lake City' />
    <meta slot="head" name="description" content='Struggling to get found online? Enchanting Apps specializes in digital marketing, website development, and AI agents that drive real results for your business.' />
    <meta slot="head" property="og:image" content='/images/rocket_01_300.jpeg' />
    <meta slot="head" property="og:title" content='Terms & Conditions | Enchanting Apps' />
    <meta slot="head" property="og:description" content='Struggling to get found online? Enchanting Apps specializes in digital marketing, website development, and AI agents that drive real results for your business.' />
    <meta slot="head" property="og:site_name" content='Enchanting Apps' />
    <meta slot="head" property="og:url" content='https://enchantingapps.com/terms-and-conditions' />
    <meta slot="head" property="og:type" content='website' />
    <meta slot="head" property="og:locale" content="en_US" />
    <meta slot="head" name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <link slot="head" rel="canonical" href="https://enchantingapps.com/terms-and-conditions" />
    <title slot="head">Terms & Conditions | Enchanting Apps</title>

    {
        /*
            // ==============================
            // container
            // ==============================
        */
    }

    <div class={ styles.termsAndConditionsContainer }>

        <HeroHeaderComponent client:load />

        {
            /*
                // ==============================
                // container > div 2 ( wrapper div )
                // ==============================
            */
        }
        <div>

            <h1>Terms & Conditions</h1>

            <p>Last updated: July 1, 2026</p>

            <p>By engaging Enchanting Apps for any service, you agree to these terms.
            Questions? Send us a message using our contact form on the
            <a href="/contact">contact page</a></p>

            <h2>Who We Are</h2>

            <p>Enchanting Apps is a digital marketing, website development, and AI agent
            development company based in Lehi, Utah.</p>

            <h2>Age Requirement</h2>

            <p>You must be at least 18 years old to engage our services or enter into
            an agreement with Enchanting Apps.</p>

            <h2>Payment Terms</h2>

            <p>Services are billed monthly or every two weeks, due at the start
            of each billing cycle. Late payments may result in a pause or termination
            of services.</p>

            <h2>Cancellation and Refund Policy</h2>

            <p>Either party may cancel services at any time with written notice. Since all
            work is custom and begins immediately upon engagement, we do not offer refunds
            once work has begun. You remain responsible for the full service fee for
            the current billing cycle at the time of cancellation.</p>

            <h2>Client Responsibilities</h2>

            <p>Timely delivery depends on your cooperation. Please provide access to
            necessary accounts and assets (website, ad accounts, etc.), respond to feedback
            requests promptly, and ensure any content you provide does not infringe on
            third-party rights. Delays caused by a lack of client cooperation are not
            the responsibility of Enchanting Apps.</p>

            <h2>Intellectual Property</h2>

            <p>Upon receipt of full payment and website completion, all original work
            for the website created for you becomes your property. We retain the right
            to display completed work in our portfolio unless you request otherwise in
            writing.</p>

            <p>Any AI agents developed during the course of our engagement remain subject
            to their own licenses. Enchanting Apps retains all rights to its pre-existing
            intellectual property, including but not limited to proprietary tools,
            frameworks, methodologies, and know-how developed independently of this
            engagement. Only the specific deliverables outlined in your service agreement
            are transferred to you upon full payment.</p>

            <h2>Third-Party Platforms</h2>

            <p>Our services may involve platforms such as Google, Meta, or other marketing
            and hosting services. We are not responsible for changes, outages, or policy
            updates made by those platforms that impact your campaigns or project.</p>

            <h2>Limitation of Liability</h2>

            <p>Enchanting Apps provides all services as-is and makes no guarantees
            regarding specific results, including but not limited to revenue growth,
            search rankings, ad performance, or AI agent outcomes. By engaging
            Enchanting Apps, you agree to hold us harmless from any and all claims,
            past, present, or future, related to the services provided.</p>

            <h2>Governing Law</h2>

            <p>These terms are governed by the laws of the State of Utah. Any disputes
            shall be resolved in the courts of Utah County, Utah.</p>

            <h2>Changes to These Terms</h2>

            <p>We may update these terms from time to time. The "Last updated" date
            at the top will always reflect the most recent version.</p>

        </div>

    </div>

</Layout>

